Domjet

Domjet is a fork of Obscura (https://github.com/h4ckf0r0day/obscura),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This fork adapts the browser engine to run as WebAssembly inside Node.js,
adds the npm browser API and integrations, and uses the Domjet name.
Upstream copyright and license notices are retained in the source.
